<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify"><I><U>Disposal of subsidiaries for the six months
ended June&nbsp;30, 2023</U></I></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">On February&nbsp;2, 2023, the Group entered into
a share transfer agreement with Kairui Consulting Hong Kong Limited (&ldquo;Karui&rdquo;), pursuant to which the Group transferred 100%
equity interest in Zhejiang Taohaoche at consideration of $2,700,000. In addition, the Group, Karui and Scytech Limited (&ldquo;Sytech&rdquo;)
entered into a settlement agreement, pursuant to which Kairui would pay $2,700 to Scytech Limited to settle the Group&rsquo;s liabilities
due to Scytech. For the year ended December&nbsp;31, 2023, Kairui made cash consideration to Scytech and the Group settled its liabilities
to Scytech. Upon disposal, Zhejiang Taohaoche&rsquo;s net assets and gain on disposal of Zhejiang Taohaoche was comprised of the following:</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLPADDING="0" CELLSPACING="0" STYLE="border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: bottom">
    <TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt">&nbsp;</TD><TD STYLE="font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; padding-bottom: 1pt">&nbsp;</TD>
    <TD COLSPAN="2" STYLE="font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold; text-align: center; border-bottom: Black 1pt solid">February&nbsp;2,<BR> 2023</TD><TD STYLE="padding-bottom: 1pt; font-size: 10pt; font-weight: bold">&nbsp;</TD></TR>
