<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>KAIXIN AUTO HOLDINGS&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>(FORMERLY KNOWN AS KAIXIN AUTO HOLDINGS)&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>NOTES TO CONDENSED CONSOLIDATED FINANCIAL STATEMENTS&nbsp;</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center"><B>(In thousands of US dollars, except share and
per share data, or otherwise noted)</B></P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
  <TR STYLE="vertical-align: top">
    <TD STYLE="width: 5%"><B>6.</B></TD>
    <TD STYLE="width: 95%; text-align: justify"><B>PAYABLE FOR SALES INCENTIVE</B></TD></TR>
  </TABLE>
<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: center">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">In the year of 2022, the Group entered into a
share grant agreement with certain dealership operators to incentivize the dealership operators to improve their sales performance. Pursuant
to the share grant agreement, the Group agreed to provide sales incentives to the dealership operators based on their sales performance.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">For the six months ended June&nbsp;30, 2024 and
2023, the Group did not grant share to these dealership operators.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify">During the six months ended June&nbsp;30, 2024
and 2023, the Group issued an aggregation of 99,832 and nil shares, respectively, to settle the payables for sales incentive. As of June&nbsp;30,
2024 and December&nbsp;31, 2023, the payable for sales incentive was $nil and $417, respectively.</P>

<P STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0">&nbsp;</P>

<TABLE CELLSPACING="0" CELLPADDING="0" STYLE="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; width: 100%; border-collapse: collapse">
